<import src="../../components/states.wxml"/><view class="page team-create"><template is="feedback" data="{{loading,error}}"/><view class="team-create-header"><image class="team-create-art" src="/images/home/shortcuts/team.png"/><view class="grow"><view class="team-create-heading">组一支温柔又坚定的小队</view><view class="team-create-subtitle">一起好好吃饭，一起坚持记录。</view></view></view><form bindsubmit="submit"><view class="card team-create-form"><view class="form-field"><text class="form-label">小队名字</text><input class="input" name="name" value="{{form.name}}" data-key="name" bindinput="input" maxlength="20" placeholder="例如：早睡早起小分队"/></view><view class="form-field"><text class="form-label">人数上限</text><picker range="{{capacities}}" value="{{capacityIndex}}" bindchange="capacity"><view class="picker">{{form.max}} 人<text class="picker-chevron">⌄</text></view></picker></view><view class="team-rule-row"><text>加入方式</text><text class="team-rule-value">{{methods[methodIndex]}}</text></view><view class="team-rule-row"><text>挑战周期</text><text class="team-rule-value">{{duration}} 天</text></view><view class="team-rule-row"><text>PK 内容</text><text class="team-rule-value">健康习惯完成率</text></view><button class="team-settings-toggle" bindtap="toggleAdvanced">更多组队设置 {{advanced?'⌃':'⌄'}}</button><view wx:if="{{advanced}}" class="team-advanced"><view class="form-field"><text class="form-label">自定义人数（3–100 人）</text><input class="input" type="number" value="{{form.max}}" data-key="max" bindinput="input"/></view><view class="form-field"><text class="form-label">加入方式</text><picker range="{{methods}}" value="{{methodIndex}}" bindchange="method"><view class="picker">{{methods[methodIndex]}} ⌄</view></picker></view><view class="form-field"><text class="form-label">挑战开始日期</text><picker mode="date" start="{{today}}" value="{{form.start}}" data-key="start" bindchange="date"><view class="picker">{{form.start}} ⌄</view></picker></view><view class="form-field"><text class="form-label">挑战结束日期（周期 7–365 天）</text><picker mode="date" start="{{form.start}}" value="{{form.end}}" data-key="end" bindchange="date"><view class="picker">{{form.end}} ⌄</view></picker></view><text class="form-label">习惯任务（至少选择 2 项）</text><checkbox-group bindchange="tasks"><label class="team-task" wx:for="{{taskOptions}}" wx:key="id"><checkbox value="{{item.id}}" checked="{{item.checked}}" color="#977bd7"/>{{item.label}}</label></checkbox-group></view></view><view class="team-create-notice"><image class="team-notice-icon" src="/images/ui/leaf.svg"/><view>免费组队，至少 3 人才能开赛。队长开始挑战后，按设定日期一起坚持 {{duration}} 天。<view class="team-schedule">{{form.start}} 至 {{form.end}}</view></view></view><button class="team-help" bindtap="rules">先看看，小队挑战怎么玩？</button><button class="team-create-submit" form-type="submit" disabled="{{busy || !form.name}}">创建小队，邀请伙伴</button></form></view>